          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 102295,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando dobbiamo usare codice lato server con la nostra pagina web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando vogliamo fornire contenuti personalizzati per l'utente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando vogliamo visualizzare una pagina con contenuti invariati</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quando vogliamo applicare stili ai nostri elementi HTML usando CSS</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando vogliamo fornire contenuti personalizzati per l'utente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una pagina deve mostrare consigli diversi a ogni utente connesso. Quando serve il codice lato server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando la pagina fornisce contenuti personalizzati per l'utente.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando la pagina mostra contenuti che non cambiano.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quando CSS applica uno stile agli elementi HTML.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando la pagina fornisce contenuti personalizzati per l'utente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 102297,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi scenari richiederebbe una connessione a un server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Prenotare un hotel da un elenco di opzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzazione dell'indirizzo di un hotel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usare un font specifico per il testo di una pagina web</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Prenotare un hotel da un elenco di opzioni.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale azione sulla pagina di un hotel richiede una connessione al server perché dipende da dati attuali scelti dall'utente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Prenotare un hotel da un elenco di opzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzazione dell'indirizzo di un hotel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usare un font specifico per il testo della pagina</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Prenotare un hotel da un elenco di opzioni.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 102298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale protocollo usano i browser per richiedere dati specifici dell'utente a un server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">HTTP</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">DNS</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">HTML</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere HTTP.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un browser deve richiedere i dati di un account a un server. Quale protocollo trasporta la richiesta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">HTTP</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">DNS</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">HTML</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Il metodo <code>POST</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere HTTP.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Server side",
            "id": 102338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di cosa si occupa il codice frontend o lato client?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Visualizzazione delle informazioni personalizzate richieste dal backend</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Memorizzare informazioni specifiche dell'utente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eseguire algoritmi complessi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Visualizzazione delle informazioni personalizzate richieste dal backend.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il backend restituisce i dati corretti del profilo, ma la pagina mostra ancora quelli vecchi. Che cosa deve fare il frontend?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiornare il profilo visualizzato usando i dati ricevuti.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mantenere la vecchia visualizzazione perché la ricezione dei dati completa l'attività.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Modificare invece il profilo memorizzato nel database del server.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiornare il profilo visualizzato usando i dati ricevuti.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Banking",
            "id": 102339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di richieste effettua il frontend di un'app di social media al momento dell'accesso?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Richieste per gli ultimi post, l'immagine del profilo dell'utente o i messaggi privati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Richieste per le regole CSS standard della pagina</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Richieste per gli elementi HTML visualizzati nella pagina</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Richieste per gli ultimi post, l'immagine del profilo dell'utente o i messaggi privati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mia esce e Leo accede allo stesso social. Layout e stili restano uguali. Che cosa deve richiedere il frontend per Leo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I post, l'immagine del profilo e i messaggi privati di Leo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo le regole CSS condivise del sito.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Di nuovo i dati di Mia, cambiando solo il nome mostrato in alto.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I post, l'immagine del profilo e i messaggi privati di Leo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 119361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come può una <code>API</code> eseguire azioni diverse?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Metodi di richiesta diversi all'<code>API</code> possono eseguire azioni diverse</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un' <code>API</code> può eseguire una sola azione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>API</code> ha una volontà propria ed è abbastanza intelligente da eseguire molte azioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Metodi di richiesta diversi all'<code>API</code> possono eseguire azioni diverse.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lo stesso endpoint API può leggere dati per una richiesta e crearli per un'altra. Che cosa gli consente di eseguire queste azioni diverse?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Metodi di richiesta diversi possono attivare azioni diverse.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un'API può eseguire una sola azione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un'API indovina automaticamente l'azione desiderata.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Metodi di richiesta diversi possono attivare azioni diverse.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 132283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una richiesta <code>GET</code> a <code>https://localhost:3000/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"GET https://localhost:3000/menu HTTP/3\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ROUTE\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Richiedi il menu da <code>https://localhost:3000/menu</code> senza modificare i dati del server. Usa il metodo HTTP per recuperare dati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"GET https://localhost:3000/menu HTTP/3\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ROUTE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"POST\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"FETCH\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 119362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>fetch</code> per chiamare l'endpoint <code>/menu</code> su localhost.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fetch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://localhost:3000/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").then(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API Request successfully sent!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fetch</code>, seguito da <code>\"http://localhost:3000/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>fetch</code> per richiedere il menu al server locale sulla porta <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fetch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://localhost:3000/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").then(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API Request successfully sent!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fetch</code>, seguito da <code>\"http://localhost:3000/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 119365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il metodo corretto per richiedere dati da un server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BRING</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELIVER</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un client deve recuperare un elenco di prodotti senza modificarlo. Quale metodo di richiesta è adatto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BRING</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELIVER</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Il metodo <code>POST</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 119366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Richiedi il framework Express.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express(); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"32\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>express</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: URL",
            "id": 102366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'endpoint <code>GET</code> per <code>/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>get</code> e infine <code>\"/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gestisci la richiesta di lettura del menu inviata da un browser. Usa <code>app</code> per registrare una route <code>GET</code> in <code>/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/food&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>app</code>, seguito da <code>get</code> e infine <code>\"/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Accept Headers",
            "id": 102972,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che il server sia in ascolto delle richieste in arrivo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"start\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>listen</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La route del menu è pronta. Completa la chiamata che permette all'app Express di accettare richieste in arrivo sulla porta <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"start\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>listen</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Request line 2",
            "id": 102962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale endpoint possiamo chiamare quando eseguiamo questo server?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>/menu</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>/</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/get</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>/menu</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambi il percorso della route da <code>/menu</code> a <code>/dishes</code>, lasciando invariato il metodo. Quale richiesta corrisponde ora?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">GET /dishes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">GET /menu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">POST /dishes</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">GET /get</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere GET /dishes.</p></body></html>",
